WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.433
Hi, I'm Tilly! Let's try the scrolling layout.

00:00:04.882 --> 00:00:06.296
Pick it from the command palette.

00:00:08.285 --> 00:00:12.346
Now panes are columns on a strip. Alt N slides along it.

00:00:12.899 --> 00:00:16.979
Control B, L, 7 makes this column 70 percent wide.

00:00:17.588 --> 00:00:20.468
Zoom slides the pane forward, and it follows your focus.

00:00:22.676 --> 00:00:24.996
Going back to tiling works the same way.

00:00:27.031 --> 00:00:29.671
Want to try it? The install guide is right here.
